   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Panos Inst. 2009-2011</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Panos London is one of 8 autonomous institutes that forms the Panos Network. Panos is one of the top leading organisations in developing knowledge and methods on how communication can be a driving force in development. It works with media and other communicators to foster debate on under-reported or misrepresented development issues,policies &amp; plans. Sida has supported Panos since the 1990ies.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Panos London &#xe4;r ett av 8 institut som utg&#xf6;r Panos n&#xe4;tverket. Panos &#xe4;r en ledande organisation i att utveckla kunskap &amp; metoder f&#xf6;r kommunikation som drivkraft i utveckling. Panos arbetar med media och andra kommunikat&#xf6;rer for att stimulera debatt om felaktigt eller underrepresenterade utvecklingsfr&#xe5;gor,policies &amp; planer. Sida har st&#xf6;tt Panos sedan 1990-talet. Har idag flera st&#xf6;d.Policy koordinerar.</narrative>
  </description>
